<title>HUNGARY: Hungary BUBOR rates down, 1-mo 22.76pct, 3-mo22.78.</title>
<headline>Hungary BUBOR rates down, 1-mo 22.76pct, 3-mo22.78.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) eased for one- and three-month maturities, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 22.76 percent, down 0.24 percentage points, while the three-month rate was fixed at 22.78 percent, down 0.17 percentage points, the NBH said on its BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
